  "question": {
    "text": "For the reaction\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& 2 \\mathrm{NO}_{2(\\mathrm{~g})} \\rightleftharpoons 2 \\mathrm{NO}_{(\\mathrm{g})}+\\mathrm{O}_{2(\\mathrm{~g})} \\text {, } \\\\\n& \\left(\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{c}}=1.8 \\times 10^{-6} \\text {at } 184 \\mathrm{C}\\right) \\\\\n& (\\mathrm{R}=0.0831 \\mathrm{~kJ} /(\\mathrm{mol} . \\mathrm{K})\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nWhen $\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{p}}$ and $\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{c}}$ are compared at $184^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$, it is found that",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "RpxeO",
      "text": "\n$\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{p}}$ is greater than $\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{c}}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "jBQYB",
      "text": "\n$\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{p}}$ is less than $\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{c}}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "mKMdD",
      "text": "\n$\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{p}}=\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{c}}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MdP14",
      "text": "\nWhether $\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{p}}$ is greater than, less than or equal to $\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{c}}$ depends upon the total gas pressure",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\mathrm{Kp}=\\mathrm{Kc} \\mathrm{RT} ^{\\Delta n}, \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{n}=1\n$$\n$$\n\\mathrm{Kp}>\\mathrm{Kc}\n$$",
    "image": null
